{{!-- Spanish pages. Ghost resolves a page's template as page-:slug.hbs -> custom-*.hbs
     -> page.hbs, so this file is a custom template: it reaches a Spanish page only when
     that page's Template setting is switched to "page-es" in the editor. There is no
     automatic route to it, because a layout cannot read the page's tags — the same
     limitation that makes custom-es.hbs necessary for posts.

     Until a page selects it, that page keeps page.hbs and declares lang="en". --}}
